  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "m20-s001",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-a",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4400,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Two weeks since go-live, so let's look back. Sarah, headline?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s002",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-b",
      "startMs": 4650,
      "endMs": 14750,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The headline is that pick rates in Building 3 are up 12 percent in the first two weeks. That's above what we promised the board."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s003",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-c",
      "startMs": 15000,
      "endMs": 19400,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "And walking distance per order is down about a fifth."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s004",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-e",
      "startMs": 19650,
      "endMs": 29370,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'm Chloé Dubois, floor supervisor in Building 3. The pickers like it, mostly. The zone layout took a few days to get used to."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s005",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-a",
      "startMs": 29620,
      "endMs": 31740,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "What didn't go well?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s006",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-d",
      "startMs": 31990,
      "endMs": 39810,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The first night, a service restarted and nobody noticed for forty minutes. Whoever was on call missed the alert."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s007",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-c",
      "startMs": 40060,
      "endMs": 42940,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "We've fixed the alert routing since."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s008",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-a",
      "startMs": 43190,
      "endMs": 46070,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Good. What's next for the pilot?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s009",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-b",
      "startMs": 46320,
      "endMs": 51480,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I want to extend it to Building 5 in Q3. Same approach."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s010",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-d",
      "startMs": 51730,
      "endMs": 54230,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The platform can handle it."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s011",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-b",
      "startMs": 54480,
      "endMs": 59640,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Then that's decided. We extend the pilot to Building 5 in Q3."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s012",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-a",
      "startMs": 59890,
      "endMs": 64290,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Before Building 5, I'd like proper feedback from the pickers."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s013",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-e",
      "startMs": 64540,
      "endMs": 68560,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll collect a picker feedback survey by June 5."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s014",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-a",
      "startMs": 68810,
      "endMs": 70550,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thank you, Chloé."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s015",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-b",
      "startMs": 70800,
      "endMs": 74820,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Owen, I'll need a budget number for Building 5."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s016",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-d",
      "startMs": 75070,
      "endMs": 80230,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll put together the budget request for Building 5 by June 12."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s017",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-a",
      "startMs": 80480,
      "endMs": 84500,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Chloé, how do the pickers prefer to get information?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s018",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-e",
      "startMs": 84750,
      "endMs": 93330,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "For the floor team, French-language documents work much better. Most of the night shift are French speakers, and so am I."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s019",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-a",
      "startMs": 93580,
      "endMs": 96460,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Useful. We'll translate the quick guide."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s020",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-b",
      "startMs": 96710,
      "endMs": 99970,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Tomás, are you comfortable with the timeline?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s021",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-c",
      "startMs": 100220,
      "endMs": 103860,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Yes. We learned a lot from Building 3."
    },
    {
      "id": "m20-s022",
      "speakerId": "m20-spk-a",
      "startMs": 104110,
      "endMs": 110030,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Great. So: Building 5 in Q3, survey by June 5, budget by June 12."
    }
  ],
  "note": {
    "version": 1,
    "body": "# Northwind pilot go-live retrospective\n\n**Date:** May 21\n**Attendees:** Alex Rivera (Larkspur Labs), Sarah Chen (Northwind Robotics), Tomás Aguilar (Northwind Robotics), Owen Barker (Northwind Robotics), Chloé Dubois (Northwind Robotics)\n\n## Summary\n\nRetrospective two weeks after the pick-path pilot went live in Building 3 at Northwind Robotics.\n\n## Results\n\n- Pick rates in Building 3 are up 12 percent in the first two weeks, above what was promised to the board.\n- Walking distance per order is down about a fifth.\n- Chloé Dubois, floor supervisor in Building 3, reports that pickers mostly like it; the zone layout took a few days to get used to.\n\n## What didn't go well\n\n- On the first night a service restarted and nobody noticed for forty minutes because the on-call alert was missed. Alert routing has since been fixed.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- **Extend the pilot to Building 5 in Q3**, using the same approach.\n- Translate the quick guide into French for the floor team.\n\n## Action items\n\n- **Chloé Dubois** — collect a picker feedback survey by June 5.\n- **Owen Barker** — put together the budget request for Building 5 by June 12.\n\n## Notes\n\n- French-language documents work much better for the floor team; most of the night shift, and Chloé herself, are French speakers.\n"
  },
